folderview.plus: FolderView Plus for Unraid
folderview.plus:
folderview.plus: Organizes Docker containers and VMs into nested folder views.
folderview.plus: Adds live previews, folder actions, rules, and bulk assignment.
folderview.plus: Includes import, export, backups, recovery, and diagnostics.
folderview.plus: Provides privacy controls and runtime performance profiles.
folderview.plus: Uses a verified, independently versioned icon asset pack.
folderview.plus: Supports Unraid 7.0.0 and newer.
